Aggregate stock events into time series. Metric is one of {{join .Metrics ", "}} (quantity is the stock level over time). Interval is one of {{join .Intervals ", "}}. Select items by ID and/or categories by tag ID ("all" for every tag), and group by one of {{join .GroupBys ", "}}. Use it to answer how fast things are used up, what was spent, or when stock will run out.
